      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775629845738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Layers:-\n1.api and network logic\n2.data layer(state management + Cacheing)\n3.UI layer(table view)",
      "fontSize": 11.79999999999999,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layers:-\n1.api and network logic\n2.data layer(state management + Cacheing)\n3.UI layer(table view)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "miVMtniawnmTVSgxnlm5a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 224,
      "y": 339,
      "width": 326.93402099609375,
      "height": 101.50000000000013,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2062129014,
      "version": 528,
      "versionNonce": 547192246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775632311687,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Api Layer\n1.Pagination(cursor)\n2.abort controller\n3.API:-columns, table Data, sorting, searching\n    new data is present or not\n4.Adapter pattern:-transforming/faltten the raw api data\n  ui friendly froamt.",
      "fontSize": 11.600000000000014,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Api Layer\n1.Pagination(cursor)\n2.abort controller\n3.API:-columns, table Data, sorting, searching\n    new data is present or not\n4.Adapter pattern:-transforming/faltten the raw api data\n  ui friendly froamt.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "byEAeY44XdgSeeR9kgCQs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 558,
      "y": 333,
      "width": 246.66363525390625,
      "height": 371.3809523809522,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 429751926,
      "version": 1351,
      "versionNonce": 1193836010,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775633112272,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "data layer\n1.map(id, data)\n2.Array:- master ids\n3.Array:- searchIds\n4.cursor(id of the last element)\n5.Optimistic Update\n    1.user changes something\n    2.immidiate update the ui\n    3.tell server to update\n    4.success:-keep it as it is(toast)\n    5.failure:-rowData,\noriginalIndex(toast)\n6.Api calls for update/delete offload\nto Serivce worker\n7. IndexDb:- cacheing + offline\nsupport\n    1.new data store in the data db\n    2.cold boot\n    3.warm boot:- head check\n8.Server side events\n\n",
      "fontSize": 13.504761904761898,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "data layer\n1.map(id, data)\n2.Array:- master ids\n3.Array:- searchIds\n4.cursor(id of the last element)\n5.Optimistic Update\n    1.user changes something\n    2.immidiate update the ui\n    3.tell server to update\n    4.success:-keep it as it is(toast)\n    5.failure:-rowData, originalIndex(toast)\n6.Api calls for update/delete offload to Serivce worker\n7. IndexDb:- cacheing + offline support\n    1.new data store in the data db\n    2.cold boot\n    3.warm boot:- head check\n8.Server side events\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J-q0qPVFbztD7nYTMFlF9",
